Dear {{recipient_name}},

We are still missing your signature on the commitment statement and training plan for {{apprentice_name}}, started {{start_date}}.

We cannot claim funding for an apprentice without a signed commitment statement in place, and an audit would treat the whole programme as ineligible. It is a short document — it sets out what each of the three parties is agreeing to.

A copy is attached to {{apprentice_name}}'s record in the employer portal, or reply and we will send it again.

{{sender_name}}
{{provider_name}}
